### Staat App Proxy — sample requests
### Works with the VS Code REST Client / Rider HTTP client. Start the API first:
###   dotnet run --project src/StaatAppProxy

@host = http://localhost:5000

### Liveness
GET {{host}}/healthz

###############################################################################
# Echo — replies with everything it received, nothing masked
###############################################################################

### Echo a POST, headers and body come straight back
POST {{host}}/echo/anything?trace=1
Authorization: Bearer some-token-that-will-be-shown-in-full
X-Correlation-Id: abc-123
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hello": "world"
}

### Echo works for any verb
DELETE {{host}}/echo/resource/42

###############################################################################
# REST proxying — endpoint "jsonplaceholder" in endpoints.json
###############################################################################

### Forwarded to https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/todos/1
GET {{host}}/api/jp/todos/1

### Query strings and bodies are carried across unchanged
POST {{host}}/api/jp/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "from the proxy",
  "body": "forwarded verbatim",
  "userId": 1
}

###############################################################################
# SSE aggregation — the reason this service exists
###############################################################################

### The raw stream, as the backend produces it (Development only)
GET {{host}}/dev/sse-sample

### The same stream, aggregated into a JSON array by the "sse-demo" endpoint:
### [{ "event": "message", "data": { "seq": 1, ... } }, ...]
GET {{host}}/api/sse-demo

### A chunked text stream folded into one value by the "sse-tokens-demo"
### endpoint (sseMode "concat"): { "result": "Hello, streaming world!" }
GET {{host}}/api/sse-tokens

###############################################################################
# On-Behalf-Of — endpoint "orders", set "enabled": true in endpoints.json first
###############################################################################

### Without a bearer token: 401 explaining what is missing
GET {{host}}/api/orders/1

### With a bearer token but no AzureAd configuration: 502 saying so
GET {{host}}/api/orders/1
Authorization: Bearer some-real-entra-access-token

###############################################################################
# Diagnostics API — what the admin UI is built on
###############################################################################

### Endpoint configuration currently in force
GET {{host}}/admin/api/config

### The last 100 exchanges, newest first
GET {{host}}/admin/api/traffic

### One exchange in full — take an id from the list above
GET {{host}}/admin/api/traffic/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Empty the capture buffer
DELETE {{host}}/admin/api/traffic
